"%(width)s × %(height)s × %(depth)s cm · %(shelves)s shelf/shelves · "
"%(positions)s position(s) · %(capacity)s unit(s) of capacity · %(linear)s cm"
" of linear shelf, %(filled)s %% filled"
msgstr "%(width)s × %(height)s × %(depth)s cm · %(shelves)s tablette(s) · %(positions)s position(s) · %(capacity)s unité(s) de capacité · %(linear)s cm de linéaire, rempli à %(filled)s %%"

